{"data":[{"ref":"lGw8ptG8t5","publishedAt":"2026-09-21T02:21:13.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T02:21:13.000Z","data":{"name":"Decaf El Mirador","slug":"decaf-el-mirador","origin":[{"ref":"cG1jGDe391","title":"Huila El Mirador"}],"tasting_notes":"Toffee, red grape, cocoa","roast":"Medium","price":"IDR 150,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/117c9291-acdc-4357-80bb-009a98ef4730.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/117c9291-acdc-4357-80bb-009a98ef4730.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/117c9291-acdc-4357-80bb-009a98ef4730.webp?w=1200","width":1280,"height":1920},"description":"<p>Sugarcane-process decaf from the same farm as El Mirador. Sweet enough that most guests never guess.</p>"}},{"ref":"L2yY4iL2BG","publishedAt":"2026-09-17T08:41:39.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-17T08:41:39.000Z","data":{"name":"Karundu AA","slug":"karundu-aa","origin":[{"ref":"cemzOJJZzb","title":"Nyeri Karundu Ridge"}],"tasting_notes":"Blackcurrant, grapefruit, tomato leaf","roast":"Light","price":"IDR 210,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/18373e5a-8c0f-45ae-b6c8-762a4827b1eb.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/18373e5a-8c0f-45ae-b6c8-762a4827b1eb.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/18373e5a-8c0f-45ae-b6c8-762a4827b1eb.webp?w=1200","width":1600,"height":1067},"description":"<p>Big, juicy and unmistakably Kenyan. Expect blackcurrant up front and a bright grapefruit acidity that settles as the cup cools.</p>"}},{"ref":"bZkB48BHye","publishedAt":"2026-09-12T03:47:53.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T03:47:53.000Z","data":{"name":"Monte Claro Honey","slug":"monte-claro-honey","origin":[{"ref":"E2Sg98abWj","title":"Tarrazú Monte Claro"}],"tasting_notes":"Apricot, honey, toasted almond","roast":"Medium","price":"IDR 160,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/78f337db-e298-4608-baa5-8ffecdeaf9d5.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/78f337db-e298-4608-baa5-8ffecdeaf9d5.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/78f337db-e298-4608-baa5-8ffecdeaf9d5.webp?w=1200","width":1600,"height":1067},"description":"<p>The Solís family run a micro-mill in San Marcos and process every lot by hand. This yellow honey is round and gentle — an easy-going coffee that still rewards attention.</p>"}},{"ref":"hQ9Smnc0XS","publishedAt":"2026-09-09T02:59:27.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T02:59:27.000Z","data":{"name":"Gayo Honey","slug":"gayo-honey","origin":[{"ref":"rq6CH45g3B","title":"Gayo Highlands"}],"tasting_notes":"Brown sugar, nutmeg, ripe plum","roast":"Medium","price":"IDR 135,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/d0f39d2d-1dd5-4d89-888f-e0ee9d844df9.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/d0f39d2d-1dd5-4d89-888f-e0ee9d844df9.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/d0f39d2d-1dd5-4d89-888f-e0ee9d844df9.webp?w=1200","width":1600,"height":1067},"description":"<p>A honey-processed lot from the Pantan Musara group in Aceh. Heavier body than our East African coffees, with warm spice and a long, syrupy finish.</p><p>Great in a French press, and a forgiving coffee for milk.</p>"}},{"ref":"10yuMYwOyw","publishedAt":"2026-09-06T04:57:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-06T04:57:00.000Z","data":{"name":"El Mirador","slug":"el-mirador","origin":[{"ref":"cG1jGDe391","title":"Huila El Mirador"}],"tasting_notes":"Red apple, panela, milk chocolate","roast":"Medium","price":"IDR 155,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/f93a9973-a6cf-4db6-b8a3-ff77565ce68a.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/f93a9973-a6cf-4db6-b8a3-ff77565ce68a.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/f93a9973-a6cf-4db6-b8a3-ff77565ce68a.webp?w=1200","width":1600,"height":1067},"description":"<p>Lucía and Andrés Pardo grow Caturra and Castillo on a steep slope above La Plata. Their washed lots are clean, sweet and endlessly drinkable — the kind of coffee you finish a bag of without noticing.</p>"}},{"ref":"rf33lYcKIX","publishedAt":"2026-09-01T04:21:12.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T04:21:12.000Z","data":{"name":"Konga Washed","slug":"konga-washed","origin":[{"ref":"Ss6tupvQdp","title":"Yirgacheffe Konga"}],"tasting_notes":"Jasmine, lemon zest, black tea","roast":"Light","price":"IDR 175,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/c6538ae4-70dc-42dd-967a-5d63f8b91b92.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/c6538ae4-70dc-42dd-967a-5d63f8b91b92.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/c6538ae4-70dc-42dd-967a-5d63f8b91b92.webp?w=1200","width":1600,"height":1067},"description":"<p>A classic washed Yirgacheffe: delicate, floral and tea-like. This is the coffee we use to train new baristas on pour-over, because every mistake shows.</p><p>Best as a V60 or Kalita at 1:16.</p>"}},{"ref":"WdvVzIYCjb","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T10:51:44.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-29T10:51:44.000Z","data":{"name":"Hambela Sunrise","slug":"hambela-sunrise","origin":[{"ref":"yxsGQHlrI0","title":"Guji Hambela"}],"tasting_notes":"Strawberry jam, bergamot, cacao nib","roast":"Light","price":"IDR 185,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/1a9e2545-53fe-48ea-baab-3f2384fe1588.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/1a9e2545-53fe-48ea-baab-3f2384fe1588.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/1a9e2545-53fe-48ea-baab-3f2384fe1588.webp?w=1200","width":1600,"height":1067},"description":"<p>Our most-requested natural. Cherries are dried for 21 days on raised beds in Hambela, and the result is a cup that tastes like a strawberry jam sandwich with a squeeze of bergamot.</p><p>Roasted light to keep the fruit loud. Rest it for at least ten days before brewing.</p>"}},{"ref":"fMX62nPxiB","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T09:08:29.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-18T09:08:29.000Z","data":{"name":"Night Shift","slug":"night-shift","origin":[{"ref":"rq6CH45g3B","title":"Gayo Highlands"}],"tasting_notes":"Molasses, cedar, bittersweet cocoa","roast":"Dark","price":"IDR 120,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/df52bc66-1f35-4e03-bb67-670b53728fcd.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/df52bc66-1f35-4e03-bb67-670b53728fcd.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/df52bc66-1f35-4e03-bb67-670b53728fcd.webp?w=1200","width":1536,"height":1920},"description":"<p>Our only properly dark roast, for moka pots, phins and anyone who misses the coffee they grew up with. Low acidity, lots of body.</p>"}},{"ref":"vEuFTLLngq","publishedAt":"2026-08-10T03:02:04.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-10T03:02:04.000Z","data":{"name":"Kala House Espresso","slug":"kala-house-espresso","origin":[{"ref":"rq6CH45g3B","title":"Gayo Highlands"}],"tasting_notes":"Dark chocolate, hazelnut, caramel","roast":"Medium","price":"IDR 125,000","bag_photo":{"url":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/32790092-7386-4414-8a8c-b88459e2d109.webp","w400":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/32790092-7386-4414-8a8c-b88459e2d109.webp?w=400","w1200":"https://demo.withflowra.com/api/img/products/4eaa6dc5-ab02-492c-97df-40f3413ee292/media/32790092-7386-4414-8a8c-b88459e2d109.webp?w=1200","width":1277,"height":1920},"description":"<p>The blend we pour in every Kala café: Gayo Honey for body, El Mirador for sweetness. Built for milk, delicious on its own.</p><p>Dial-in starting point: 18 g in, 38 g out, 28–30 seconds.</p>"}}],"meta":{"total":9,"limit":20,"offset":0,"contentVersion":1}}